# Stress Test Application (Docker + Python)

## Overview
This project is a simple stress testing application built using Python and Docker.

## Features
- Simulates CPU load
- Runs inside Docker container
- Easy to start and stop

## Technologies Used
- Python
- Docker

## How to Run

### Build Docker Image
docker build -t stress-app .

### Run Container
docker run stress-app

### Run in Background
docker run -d stress-app

### Stop Container
docker ps
docker stop <container_id>

